+**A checker that scrapes source with a regex will lie to you.** The first
+version of `check-selectors.mjs` reported every selector valid while the six
+broken ones were still in place, because it had silently extracted 11 of 70.
+Both obvious regexes fail the same way: `[^'"`]+` for a string body stops at the
