-running against local Chromium, then fix the six invalid selectors. That turns a
-blind redeploy loop into one round trip. Then take **one** platform end to end
-with real credentials on the server.
+Take **one** platform end to end with real credentials on the server — Filmmakers
+or Wanted, the two with the most complete browser paths. Run a sync, let it fail,
+read the capture. That is the round trip the forensics exist for, and it replaces
+guessing at markup nobody in this project has seen.
+
+Do not fix the speculative selectors before that; without evidence it is the same
+blind redeploy loop, only with more code.
 
